('c3d4e5f6-3333-4444-5555-666677778888', '4771cdf2-fa08-44c7-8d07-54d9b2f9280e', 'Inverter', 'Component that converts DC power to AC power for CCFL backlights in older LCD displays.', 'The failing inverter caused the laptop screen to appear dim or flicker.', 6, '2025-08-05T12:00:00Z', '2025-08-05T12:00:00Z'),
